  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is a vector quantity such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math> non-zero constant. Which of the following expression is true for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>?",
