  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since both the vectors are same, they will be parallel to each other. We know that vector&nbsp;product of two parallel vectors is zero.</p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is the correct answer.</p>",
